Cell["\<\
The following graph illustrates the behavior of the second pendulum in terms \
of: \[Theta]2[t] and \[Theta]2'[t].   We are going to illustrate the changing \
2-dimensional slice of the four-dimensional phase plane only over the time \
interval from 0 to 4.  This shorter time interval still contains significant \
behavior, as illustrated by the second pendulum \"looping\" over the \"top\" \
at the end of our time interval:\
\>", "Text",
